%% Title: MediSearch AI Assistant and Health Alert Flow
flowchart TB
  User[Patient Query or Drug Detail View] --> Backend[Backend API]
  Backend --> Safety[Medical Safety Guardrails]
  Safety --> Intent{Intent Type}
  Intent -->|Find alternatives| Alternatives[Drug Alternative Workflow]
  Intent -->|Need recommendation| Recommend[Recommendation Workflow]
  Intent -->|Risk or stock event| Alert[Health and Stock Alert Workflow]

  Alternatives --> Compare[Compare active ingredients, category, availability, price]
  Recommend --> Personalize[Use search history, favorites, inventory context]
  Alert --> Detect[Detect low stock, price changes, repeated demand]

  Compare --> Review[Rank and explain results]
  Personalize --> Review
  Detect --> Notify[Generate notification]
  Review --> Response[Return ranked suggestions]
  Notify --> Response
  Response --> User
